{"speciesId":366,"names":{"fr":"Coquiperl","es":"Clamperl","en":"Clamperl","ja":"パールル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CLAMPERL’s sturdy shell is not only good for protection - it is also used for clamping and catching prey. A fully grown CLAMPERL’s shell will be scored with nicks and scratches all over."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CLAMPERL grows while being protected by its rock-hard shell. When its body becomes too large to fit inside the shell, it is sure evidence that this POKéMON is getting close to evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A CLAMPERL slams its shell closed on prey to prevent escape. The pearl it creates upon evolution is said to be infused with a mysterious energy."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ne produit qu’une perle durant son existence. On raconte qu’elle amplifie les pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ne produit qu’une perle durant son existence. On raconte qu’elle amplifie les pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ne produit qu’une perle durant son existence, quand il évolue. Elle amplifie les pouvoirs psychiques."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Produce durante su vida una sola perla que aumenta los poderes psíquicos al evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"一生に １回 進化の とき サイコパワーを 増幅する 不思議な 真珠を 作るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon ferme sa coquille pour se protéger du danger. Il ne crée qu’une seule perle de toute sa vie, mais celle-ci est magnifique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está protegido por una sólida concha. Puede llegar a formar una perla extraordinaria."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頑丈な 殻に 守られて 一生の うちに １個だけ 見事な 真珠を 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La puissante coquille de Coquiperl ne sert pas qu’à le protéger. Elle lui permet également de pincer et d’attraper sa proie. Une coquille de Coquiperl adulte porte souvent de nombreuses égratignures et éraflures."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La sólida concha que rodea a Clamperl no solo le sirve para protegerse, sino también de cepo para atrapar a su presa. Cuando la concha alcanza su mayor tamaño, presenta muescas y rasguños por todas partes."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Clamperl’s sturdy shell is not only good for protection—it is also used for clamping and catching prey. A fully grown Clamperl’s shell will be scored with nicks and scratches all over."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頑丈な カラは 身を 守る だけではなく 獲物を 挟んで 捕まえる ことも できる。 育った パールルの 貝殻は キズだらけ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Coquiperl grandit protégé par sa coquille dure comme de la pierre. Lorsque son corps devient trop grand pour sa coquille, cela signifie que ce Pokémon va bientôt évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Clamperl crece protegido por la sólida concha que tiene. Si vemos que el cuerpo no le cabe, será porque está a punto de evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Clamperl grows while being protected by its rock-hard shell. When its body becomes too large to fit inside the shell, it is sure evidence that this Pokémon is getting close to evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"硬い 貝殻に 守られて 成長する。 本体が カラに 収まり 切らなくなると 進化の 瞬間が 近づいた 証拠。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Malgré les apparences, c’est un carnivore qui attrape sa proie avec sa coquille et l’immobilise jusqu’à ce qu’elle ne se débatte plus."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon, que no aparenta ser carnívoro, atrapa a sus presas con ambas conchas y no las suelta hasta que dejan de moverse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Despite its appearance, it’s carnivorous. It clamps down on its prey with both sides of its shell and doesn’t let go until they stop moving."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"こう見えて 肉食。 ２枚の カラで 獲物を がっちり 挟んで 動かなくなるまで 離さない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La perle de Coquiperl est tellement précieuse qu’elle peut valoir plus de dix fois la valeur de celle de Kokiyas."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La perla que contiene vale un potosí. De hecho, su precio puede llegar a ser incluso más de diez veces superior al de la perla de Shellder."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Clamperl’s pearls are exceedingly precious. They can be more than 10 times as costly as Shellder’s pearls."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"パールルの 真珠は とても 貴重。 シェルダーの 真珠の １０倍以上 価値が あるとも。"}],"varieties":[{"id":366,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"egg",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machin